' ==========================================================
' 图 2-7a  OCR 任务状态图
' 建议幅面：通栏 14.6 x 10 cm（约 3/4 页；本图是第 2 章核心图之一，允许做大）
' 说明：状态与迁移均对照 ocr_service/queue.py + api.py 的实际实现绘制
' ==========================================================
@startuml 图2-7a_OCR任务状态图
title 图2-7a  OCR 任务状态图

skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 26
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam DefaultFontColor #1F2933
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam StateBorderColor #5D6D7E
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FCF3CF

[*] --> queued : POST /jobs 成功\n占用 active_job_id, generation+1

state "queued 排队中" as queued : 等待 worker 领取，available_at 到期后可被扫描
state "running 执行中" as running : attempts ≥ 1，持有 lease_token
state "retry_wait 等待重试" as retry_wait : 存在失败页且 attempts < 3，退避 15/30 秒
state "succeeded 全部成功" as succeeded : 所有页 succeeded
state "partial_success 部分成功" as partial : attempts 耗尽且部分页失败
state "failed 失败" as failed : attempts 耗尽且全部页失败
state "cancelled 已取消" as cancelled : 用户主动取消，配额预留随之退还

queued --> running : worker 条件更新领取\nattempts+1, lease_until = now + 120 s
running --> running : 心跳续租（每 40 秒刷新 lease_until）
running --> running : 租约到期后被另一 worker 接管\n原 lease_token 提交被拒绝
running --> succeeded : complete_attempt：全部页成功
running --> partial : attempts = 3 且存在成功页
running --> failed : attempts = 3 且无成功页
running --> retry_wait : 存在失败页 且 attempts < 3
retry_wait --> running : 到期再次被领取（attempts+1）
queued --> cancelled : POST /jobs/{id}/cancel
retry_wait --> cancelled : POST /jobs/{id}/cancel
running --> cancelled : POST /jobs/{id}/cancel
failed --> queued : POST /jobs/{id}/retry\n（attempts 归零，仅当无更新代次）
partial --> queued : POST /jobs/{id}/retry\n（仅重跑失败页，成功页保留）
succeeded --> [*] : 释放 active_job_id
failed --> [*] : 释放 active_job_id
partial --> [*] : 释放 active_job_id
cancelled --> [*] : 释放 active_job_id

note bottom of running
  终态集合 = {succeeded, partial_success, failed, cancelled}；
  只有持有匹配 lease_token 且 lease_until 未过期的 worker 才能提交结果。
end note
@enduml


' ==========================================================
' 图 2-7b  页面与检索索引同步状态图
' 建议幅面：通栏 14.6 x 7 cm（约半页）
' ==========================================================
@startuml 图2-7b_页面状态图
title 图2-7b  页面与全文索引同步状态图

skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 26
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam DefaultFontColor #1F2933
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam StateBorderColor #5D6D7E
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FCF3CF

[*] --> pending : 任务创建时为每页生成 Page 行

state "pending 待处理" as pending : job_id + page_no 唯一
state "succeeded 成功" as succeeded : result(JSON) = 文字框 + 文本 + 置信度
state "failed 失败" as failed : error 字段记录失败码

pending --> succeeded : 本页识别并写入成功\n同事务 upsert pdf_text_index
pending --> failed : 本页识别失败\n保留此前成功索引不被覆盖
failed --> pending : 任务级 retry 重置失败页\n（成功页不回退）
succeeded --> succeeded : PATCH 校对\nrevision+1 并同步索引

failed --> [*] : 任务终态后提供按页重试入口
succeeded --> [*] : 可被检索命中并展示 job_id / revision

note right of failed
  失败页不会清空 pdf_text_index，
  检索仍返回上一次成功结果，并标注其 job_id 与 revision。
end note
@enduml
